# Git LFS is scoped to ONE path on purpose: the 聴解 MP3s under tests/, which are
# deliverables (~30 MB each, ~0.5 GB total — inside the free tier).
#
# It used to be repo-wide `*.pdf` + `*.mp3`, which swept in the 2.6 GB refs/
# archive and blew the account's LFS budget. Once a budget is exhausted the LFS
# batch API refuses EVERY object, so `actions/checkout` itself fails and no CI
# deploy can run at all. refs/ is now out of git (see .gitignore and AGENTS.md
# §3 for where the archive comes from) — do NOT restore a repo-wide *.pdf/*.mp3
# rule, and do not commit the archive back.
tests/**/*.mp3 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
